  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v1.12.7 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n* fix(security): validate OpenSearch connector URLs by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15756\n* fix(security): scope original-file S3 uploads by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15757\n* fix(deps): dependency upgrades for 1.12.7 by @Adam-Aghili in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15762\n* fix(security): reject process and code loader capabilities by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15758\n* fix(api): reconstruct workflow status without component instantiation by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15781\n* fix(kb): honor environment fallback and redact connection errors by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15783\n* fix(security): preserve jq conditional expressions during validation by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15782\n* fix(security): block runtime object recovery in generated components by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15873\n* fix(security): enforce admin policy on public component builds by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15874\n* fix(security): reject runtime loader and environment capabilities by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15879\n* fix: backport runtime URL prefixes and cookie isolation to 1.12.7 by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15880\n* fix(security): enforce model policy in standalone builders by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15877\n* fix(security): restrict non-owner graph overrides and local cleanup by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15878\n* fix(security): separate saved flows from public history identifiers by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15876\n* fix(deps): keep core package versions aligned on 1.12.7 by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15900\n### ✅ Tests\n* test(files): verify unsafe renames preserve safe downloads by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15759\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/compare/v1.12.6...v1.12.7",
